 "remarks": "Located on the brim of vibrant downtown Stamford and in the heart of the popular Fairgate community, this newer townhome is super spacious + accommodating, offering 1275 square feet! Inside you'll find a designer kitchen with cool new granite countertops, opening to the bright + sunny window-lined living + dining areas featuring extra windows + fresh paint. This townhome has it's own entrance on a tree-lined street with sidewalks, features professional landscaping, on-site management + 24-hour security. Residents enjoy a meticulously maintained, pet-friendly environment - and - BONUS - access to popular Fairgate organic Farm! Central A/C, economical gas heat, 5-star energy rated appliances And NO ADDITIONAL FEES put this townhouse on your \"must see\" list! Applicants must complete the Fairgate application uploaded in supplements and credit check through Rentspree or Applyconnect only.",
